admin can do everything,

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:20.040
I have a user, he
can do three things,

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.390
now you get a lot more granular.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:25.350
So I can say, Mark
can create clusters.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:26.760
