one true way to do anything.

00:22:26.695 --> 00:22:27.570
MARK MANDEL: For now.

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:27.980
For now.

00:22:27.980 --> 00:22:28.510
FRANCESC CAMPOY:
Yeah, that is true.

00:22:28.510 --> 00:22:29.500
CARTER MORGAN: Especially
because Kubernetes

00:22:29.500 --> 00:22:30.640
wants to be so open.

00:22:30.640 --> 00:22:33.340
But if I was going to do
local development right now,

00:22:33.340 --> 00:22:35.580
and what I've been playing
with myself, is Minikube.

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:36.819
MARK MANDEL: That's fair.

